BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-27T05:50:04&endDate=2026-08-28T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nCentral Line: Severe delays between Loughton and Epping while we fix equipment damaged by vandalism. If you are travelling beyond Loughton you will need to take the first train and change there. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses and Greater Anglia (Liverpool Street - Harlow Town). MINOR DELAYS on the rest of the line due to train cancellations. 
DTEND:20260828T002900Z
DTSTART:20260827T055004Z
SUMMARY:Central: Severe Delays
